  "solution": {
    "text": "Change the inequalities into equations and draw the graph of lines, thus we get the required feasible region as shown below.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/PM-tPvPQ2yDHDSeIf6ZrVRVLLrMIduwNfTr1Y8ScXcU.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />The region bounded by the vertices $A(0,5), B(4,3), C(7,0)$<br />The objective function is maximum at $\\mathrm{C}(7,0)$ and $\\operatorname{Max} z=5 \\times 7+2 \\times 0=35$.",
